# Greyscale Moshi — dark half of the Ghostty light/dark pair.
# Selected by ghostty/config: theme = dark:greyscale-moshi-dark,light:greyscale-moshi-light
#
# ANSI 16 = full koda-dark terminal mapping (verbatim from moshi/greyscale-theme.json
# "Greyscale (Koda Dark)"); yellow/blue/cyan slots are white/greys, red/green/magenta
