# Surfaces match moshi: bg #101010, fg #b0b0b0, selection #272727.
# See themes/GREYSCALE.md → "Greyscale Moshi" and "Greyscale Moshi Light".
# (previous all-grey ANSI table: git history of ghostty/config before 2026-09 light/dark split)

